WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.250
- [Grizzlies announcer:] Ball at the top. 
Ja intercepts the pass. He's off!

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.500
Look at those hops. He can leap 
out of the gym!

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:10.250
- Oh, no. It happened. I jumped too high.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.375
- [Modern announcer:] Welcome to the arena outside of space and time,

00:00:12.375 --> 00:00:16.000
where we have 2022 
Temetrius "Ja" Morant

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.750
- [Old-school announcer:] vs. 2001 
Vince "Half Man Half Amazing" Carter.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:22.791
- Woaaaah.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:25.625
- I gotta remember that dunk for next year.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.875
- Wow, I gotta say: I'm a huge fan.

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.541
- Let me guess...poster on your wall?

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:31.375
- [Old-school announcer:] You both know why you're here.

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:33.416
- Because I'm the most exciting player in the league.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.125
Jinx!

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:37.000
- [Modern announcer:] Rules are simple: 
Game to 11, win by two.

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:40.708
- [Old-school announcer:] And Ja with the 
acrobatic finish.

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:43.125
- That ain't nothing. Check this out.

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.875
- You know that's trademark infringement.

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:52.166
- Shooting: one of the few weak 
spots in Ja's game.

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:52.708
- My turn.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.375
- Holy Vinsanity, baby.

00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:58.375
- Mouse in the house!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.375
- Oh, watch your pockets.

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:05.333
- [Old-school announcer:] Ja, with that 
grit-and-grind mentality.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.750
- You know, not every play 
has to be in the "Top 10."

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:10.916
Why not?

00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:14.916
- [Modern announcer:] Ja with the rare defensive highlight we'll share on Insta.

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:16.375
- I see we playin' for real now.

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.166
- [Old-school announcer:] Vince with the poster!

00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:21.583
- [Fan 1:] Woo!
- [Fan 2:] I feel young again!

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.291
- [Modern announcer:] Ja with the 
non-fungible token.

00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.000
- [Fan 1:] Dunk over a car!

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.916
- This is why I don't do dunk contests.

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:34.166
- [Modern announcer:] Vince racking up frequent flyer miles.

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:37.000
- [Old-school announcer:] Is it traveling if you take four steps in the air?

00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:39.541
- [Fan 1:] A three?

00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:41.916
- [Fan 2:] Boo!
- [Fan 3:] We wanna see more dunks!

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:43.708
- I'm more than just a dunker.

00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:48.125
- [Old-school announcer:] Eh, Vince is just playing regular basketball now...and he misses.

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:51.000
- If it ain't at the rim, I don't think you got it.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.000
- You sure?

00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:53.625
- Lucky-ass shot.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.375
- Oh! Rare L for Ja there.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.750
- Now game point!

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.000
- Gettin' ready for your future as a role player?

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.125
- Maybe. But today ain't that day.

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:08.750
- [Old-school announcer:] Vince jumps and—

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.000
- [Modern announcer:] They just keep rising!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.875
- [Old-school announcer:] Oh, no! It looks like Ja is starting to descend.

00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:18.625
- [Modern announcer:] Vince wins with the clutch hang-time finish.

00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:21.333
- I woulda had you if it wasn't for gravity.

00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:23.500
- Sure that wasn't just the weight of expectations?

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.541
- You got jooooookes!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.583
- [Grizzlies announcer:] Wow, Ja is back and look 
how improved he is!

